cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the article and the archived software release."
title: "marineSim: spatio-temporal random forests for marine species distribution modelling under data limitation"
abstract: >-
  Simulation benchmark, R package and applied analysis for the spatio-temporal random
  forest (stRF) method. stRF augments an ordinary random forest with multi scale spatial
  lags, temporal features and Euclidean distance fields, and is evaluated against a
  generalised linear model, a generalised additive model, a standard random forest, a
  spatial random forest and an sdmTMB Matérn random field comparator across a factorial simulation
  and a Posidonia sinuosa seagrass case study in Western Australia.
